  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Challenge to Change 3.0 ,SERDA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Challenge to Change 3.0, SERDA - Challenge to Change 3.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The  overall objective of the project is contribution to the enhanced competitiveness and sustainable socio-economic development in Bosnia and Herzegovina. The project is designed to contribute to more developed and equal opportunity society in Bosnia and Herzegovina. It aims to promote and support improvements through identifying innovative potential in the country and engaging it for social advancements leading towards economic development. 

The specific objective is to improve risk sharing funding for innovative and/or inclusive businesses.

The project will contribute to reduction of unemployment and poverty utilizing innovative and sustainable approach.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att fr&#xe4;mja och st&#xf6;dja f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringen av landets ekonomi genom att identifiera innovativ potential i landet och engagera den f&#xf6;r sociala framsteg och ekonomisk utveckling. Utmaningsfonden underl&#xe4;ttar riktade &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder f&#xf6;r att ge st&#xf6;d till innovation och frig&#xf6;ra ekonomisk potential bland kapaciterade akt&#xf6;rer. Den &#xe4;r baserad p&#xe5; mycket konkurrenskraftiga och transparenta f&#xf6;rfaranden f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla ett neutralt tillv&#xe4;gag&#xe5;ngss&#xe4;tt och stimulera tillv&#xe4;xt</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote and support the improvement of country&#xb4;s economy through Identifying innovative potential and engaging it for social advancement and economic development. The Challenge Fund facilitates targeted action to prompt support to innovation and unlock economic potential among capacitated players. It is based on highly  competitive and transparent procedures to ensure non-bias approach and stimulate growth.</narrative>
  </description>
